## 1.6 — How to Reset/Recreate Tables

If you ever need to start fresh:

1. Go to **Supabase Dashboard** → **SQL Editor**
2. Paste the contents of [setup_tables_v2.sql](file:///c:/Users/lalit/Desktop/kadaigpt-main/kadaigpt-main/setup_tables_v2.sql)
3. Click **Run**

> [!CAUTION]
> This script starts with `DROP TABLE IF EXISTS ...` — it will **delete all your data**! Only do this in development or if you want a clean slate.

