---

## 2.8 — Local Development vs Vercel

| Aspect | Local (your PC) | Vercel (production) |
|--------|----------------|-------------------|
| Run command | `uvicorn app.main:app --reload` | Automatic |
| Database | Same Supabase (or local SQLite) | Same Supabase |
| Files | Saved to disk | Saved to `/tmp/` (ephemeral!) |
| Background tasks | Scheduler + keepalive run | Skipped |
| Cold starts | None (always running) | ~7s first request |
| Logs | Terminal output | Vercel dashboard |
| URL | `http://localhost:8000` | `https://kadaigpt-main.vercel.app` |

---

## 2.9 — Common Vercel Commands

```bash
# Install Vercel CLI (one time)
npm i -g vercel

# Login to Vercel
vercel login

# Deploy from command line (preview)
vercel

# Deploy to production
vercel --prod

# Pull environment variables locally
vercel env pull .env.local

# View logs
vercel logs kadaigpt-main
```

